{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Divine Intervention: Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>beautifully immersive, interactive simulation</strong> that blends <strong>adventure, exploration, and discovery.</strong> Travel through the vastness of space and across the Earth as you trace the revelations of the holy Quran, where <strong>every corner of the world is interactive</strong> and <strong>speaks to you through references from the scripture</strong>, history, and science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/d4d11ad82c28a66958b0ab4475aa58c1.poster.avif?t=1758898481\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/d4d11ad82c28a66958b0ab4475aa58c1.webm?t=1758898481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Verify the Claims Made in the Holy Quran</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;If this book was from other than God, they would have been able to find many contradictions in it&quot;</i> (Quran 4:92)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revealed 1400 years ago to Prophet Muhammad PBUH, a man who could neither read nor write, in the deserts of Arabia, the Quran makes bold and fascinating claims that still resonate today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/4c2d290475b8a0113a3c328f1858d47b.poster.avif?t=1758898481\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/4c2d290475b8a0113a3c328f1858d47b.webm?t=1758898481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the expansion of the universe to internal sea waves, this interactive journey invites you to explore <strong>50+ of these claims</strong> with a broader touch on Islamic knowledge, in an engaging, cinematic format never before experienced, as you examine their historical and scientific consistency and how they align with modern discoveries across fields like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hydrology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embryology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meteorology</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...And beyond!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All with curated links and resources for those who like to take a deeper dive and further research.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandsurf</strong> &amp; <strong>Spaceglide</strong> in a Thrilling Journey with a Deeper Purpose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide and surf golden sand dunes, soar through breathtaking landscapes, and <strong>master the art of carpet flight</strong> as you navigate vast deserts and cosmic expanses. Experience fluid movement mechanics that make traversing vast deserts and navigating through space equally rewarding. This adventure serves as <strong>an invitation to explore the Quran and Islamic knowledge while connecting with divine wisdom</strong> through an experience that enlightens as much as it entertains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/e3e3d78cd9da949fa6e89399f318e8ae.poster.avif?t=1758898481\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/e3e3d78cd9da949fa6e89399f318e8ae.webm?t=1758898481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're surfing across shifting sands or piloting your carpet through stellar fields, every moment of travel is as thrilling as it is purposeful. <strong>Experience this unique journey firsthand - play the demo now</strong> and discover what awaits in this breathtaking odyssey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/ea8a604a885beb6620179ab0920ae3cb.poster.avif?t=1758898481\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/ea8a604a885beb6620179ab0920ae3cb.webm?t=1758898481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help Shape the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We're developing Divine Intervention with care and passion. <strong>Join our Discord</strong> to provide feedback, connect with other players, and directly help shape this unique experience as we build it together into its best form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016850/extras/6c4a17beae5fcce17cc7e3d556f2d694.avif?t=1758898481\" width=700 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0God Bless</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ua9c1\u239d\u00a0 \u00a0\ud80c\udda9\u0f3a\u2727\